+/*
+ * SELinux policy patching for KernelSU.
+ *
+ * Two completely different installation paths exist:
+ *
+ *  - 5.10+ (or vendor kernels that backported struct selinux_policy):
+ *    the policy is an RCU protected, immutable object. We clone it, patch the
+ *    clone and swap the pointer. No locking tricks needed.
